<rules>
- For company-specific research routes (`full_10k_report`, `dcf_valuation_only`, etc.), extract the target stock ticker and fiscal year from the user request or catalog context.
- For `conversational` inquiries, extracted_ticker and extracted_year can be null (or inherit active session ticker if referring to it).
- Never invent ticker symbols or assume entities not referenced or present in the catalog.
- If no specific fiscal year is mentioned for a company analysis, default to the latest available audited fiscal year or active session year.
- Always output valid structured JSON conforming to `SupervisorExtraction`.
</rules>
